-### Animated Line Plot
-Create an animated line plot:
-
-```cpp
-DataLinear x(100);
-float phase = 0;
-
-void setup(void) {
-  gfx.begin();
-  plot.set_color_map(rainbow);
-}
-
-void loop(void) {
-  plot.clear_screen();
-  
-  // Create animated function
-  DataFunction y(100, [](size_t x) {
-    return sin(x / 10.0 + phase);
-  });
-  
-  plot.line(x, y, y);
-  phase += 0.1;
-  delay(50);
-}
-```
