-The numeric check validates every binary16 encoding and finite rounding interval, then exercises float/FP16 sources, borrowed casts, ranges, interpolation, splines and projection. The plotting check uses a host drawing-call recorder to instantiate both complete pipelines and check representative pixel endpoints. The recorder does not emulate hardware or rasterization.
